WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.134 --> 00:00:02.302
-Welcome back to
"The Tonight Show."

00:00:02.302 --> 00:00:03.736
I'm hanging out
with my good friend.

00:00:03.736 --> 00:00:06.105
I'm hanging out with my son,
Post Malone.

00:00:06.105 --> 00:00:08.140
Post.
-What's up, Dad?

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:10.676
-Since you are about
to launch your brand-new

00:00:10.676 --> 00:00:13.980
Celebrity World Pong League,
I wanted to challenge you

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:18.184
to the Every Drinking Game Ever
Challenge.

00:00:18.184 --> 00:00:21.421
♪ -Every drinking game
challenge ♪

00:00:21.421 --> 00:00:22.989
-Okay.

00:00:22.989 --> 00:00:26.659
Post, this first one
is a classic.

00:00:26.659 --> 00:00:29.996
The first game we're about
to play is Flip Cup.

00:00:29.996 --> 00:00:34.500 line:0%
-Flip Cup. First one to drink
and flip all their cups wins.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:35.869
-Are you nervous at all?

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:36.869
-Not at all.

00:00:36.869 --> 00:00:38.537
-Ready?

00:00:38.537 --> 00:00:39.539
-Yes, sir.

00:00:39.539 --> 00:00:41.707
-Set. Go!

00:00:41.707 --> 00:00:47.313 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:47.313 --> 00:00:48.748
-Oh, my God.

00:00:48.748 --> 00:00:55.788 line:0%
♪♪

00:00:55.788 --> 00:01:02.828 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:02.828 --> 00:01:04.730
[ Dinging ]
-Oh! What's up, dude?!

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:06.499
Yo! What is up, dude?!

00:01:06.499 --> 00:01:08.234
What is up, man?! Blah!

00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:11.003
[ Laughs ]

00:01:11.003 --> 00:01:12.338
-Quarters.

00:01:12.338 --> 00:01:16.508 line:0%
Bounce the quarter off the table
into the glass.

00:01:16.508 --> 00:01:17.610
-I'm going to be
straight with you.

00:01:17.610 --> 00:01:18.844
I've never played this game.

00:01:18.844 --> 00:01:20.346
It seems a bit primordial.

00:01:20.346 --> 00:01:21.647
-Alright, ready? Here we go.

00:01:21.647 --> 00:01:24.283
On your mark. Get set. Go.

00:01:24.283 --> 00:01:27.520 line:0%
♪♪

00:01:27.520 --> 00:01:29.288
-Oh, no.

00:01:29.288 --> 00:01:31.824
-God. That one went backward.

00:01:31.824 --> 00:01:33.592
Oh, my gosh!

00:01:33.592 --> 00:01:34.660
Yo!

00:01:34.660 --> 00:01:36.529
[ Dinging ]
Oh, my gosh!

00:01:36.529 --> 00:01:38.298
Dude, what is happening?

00:01:38.298 --> 00:01:41.267
Grandpa's got to get
back out on the scene!

00:01:41.267 --> 00:01:42.668
You missed the --

00:01:42.668 --> 00:01:45.004
This is like old timer's day
at the ballpark.

00:01:45.004 --> 00:01:46.706
I come limping out.

00:01:46.706 --> 00:01:48.341
Can we have a replay of that,
Dave,

00:01:48.341 --> 00:01:51.144
just so Post can see
the magic of this?

00:01:51.144 --> 00:01:52.578
Watch this. Watch this gem.

00:01:52.578 --> 00:01:54.413
Boing!
-Oh, my God.

00:01:54.413 --> 00:01:57.383
-Doing!
[ Laughs ]

00:01:57.383 --> 00:01:58.885
Ah!

00:01:58.885 --> 00:02:01.621
Enjoy that cold beverage,
my friend.

00:02:01.621 --> 00:02:03.322
Cheers.
-Cheers, Jim.

00:02:03.322 --> 00:02:05.324
-Cheers, bud.

00:02:05.324 --> 00:02:06.625
-Never Have I Ever.

00:02:06.625 --> 00:02:08.695 line:0%
Put a finger down
if you've done the deed.

00:02:08.695 --> 00:02:12.165 line:0%
First person with all fingers
down loses.

00:02:12.165 --> 00:02:14.400
-Three fingers up. I will start.

00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:19.939
Never have I ever, uh,
lost $1,000 on a bet.

00:02:19.939 --> 00:02:23.375
-Specifically $1,000?
-In that ballpark.

00:02:23.375 --> 00:02:25.778
-Or over?
-Over?

00:02:25.778 --> 00:02:28.848
-Yeah, I've made some dumb bets
in my life.

00:02:28.848 --> 00:02:31.050
So are you saying over $1,000?

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:33.419
-Yeah, I'm going to say $10,000.

00:02:33.419 --> 00:02:36.222
-Okay, let's do $10,000, too.
Okay.

00:02:36.222 --> 00:02:39.325
-You got to put a finger down,
oh, my gosh.

00:02:39.325 --> 00:02:42.094
Okay. Alright, now you ask.

00:02:42.094 --> 00:02:47.933
-Never have I ever...

00:02:47.933 --> 00:02:52.472
taken the postal exam
as a career fallback.

00:02:52.472 --> 00:02:53.706
-[ Laughs ]

00:02:53.706 --> 00:02:55.374
You sadly know
too much about me.

00:02:55.374 --> 00:02:59.412
My parents really believed in
my comedy career and I was a --

00:02:59.412 --> 00:03:01.146
I would have been
a great mailman.

00:03:01.146 --> 00:03:03.115
And I got job offers.

00:03:03.115 --> 00:03:04.350
And they would have loved me.

00:03:04.350 --> 00:03:05.718
But, yes, I have done that.

00:03:05.718 --> 00:03:10.723
And gosh, I love the post office
and I love postal workers.

00:03:11.757 --> 00:03:14.860
Okay, my man, have you ever --

00:03:14.860 --> 00:03:17.196
never have I ever gone out

00:03:17.196 --> 00:03:20.133
for drinking one night and then
woke up in a different city.

00:03:22.735 --> 00:03:24.103
Actually, you know what?

00:03:24.103 --> 00:03:25.905
That's bad for me
because I have done that.

00:03:25.905 --> 00:03:28.241
-Yeah, I'll drink too.
Cheers, sir.

00:03:28.241 --> 00:03:30.076
[ Laughter ]

00:03:30.076 --> 00:03:31.678
-Two times.

00:03:32.778 --> 00:03:34.213
You got one for me?

00:03:34.213 --> 00:03:39.352
-Never have I ever been mistaken
for another celebrity.

00:03:39.352 --> 00:03:42.155
-Oh, my gosh.
That happens to me all the time.

00:03:42.155 --> 00:03:44.290
Tom Cruise. Every time I go out.

00:03:44.290 --> 00:03:45.791
-Tom Cruise?

00:03:45.791 --> 00:03:47.159
-Yeah, absolutely, yeah.

00:03:47.159 --> 00:03:50.029
Tom Cruise, yeah, all the time.

00:03:50.029 --> 00:03:54.133
-I'll put mine down too 'cause
I get Brad Pitt all the time.

00:03:54.133 --> 00:03:55.368
-Beer Pong.

00:03:55.368 --> 00:03:57.737 line:0%
Throw a Ping-Pong ball
in your opponent's cups.

00:03:57.737 --> 00:04:00.873 line:0%
