Here we go.

00:04:06.179 --> 00:04:09.381
Hey, do you soak your ball?

00:04:09.381 --> 00:04:10.949
Do you get it wet
before you throw?

00:04:10.949 --> 00:04:12.284
-Yes, sir.

00:04:12.284 --> 00:04:14.987
You know, it's impoi--
it's "impoitant" to make it --

00:04:14.987 --> 00:04:16.155
[ Laughs ]

00:04:16.155 --> 00:04:17.290
It's impoitant to make it --

00:04:17.290 --> 00:04:20.560
-Of "coirse."
Of coirse it's impoitant.

00:04:20.560 --> 00:04:21.927
Here we go, bud.

00:04:21.927 --> 00:04:24.763 line:0%
♪♪

00:04:24.763 --> 00:04:27.366
Oh, gosh.
-That's alright. That's alright.

00:04:27.366 --> 00:04:29.068
-Come on, bud.
Let's see what you got.

00:04:29.068 --> 00:04:31.070 line:0%
♪♪

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:33.405 line:0%
-Ooh!
-Aah!

00:04:33.405 --> 00:04:36.241
Gosh darn. Which one?
Top one you did?

00:04:36.241 --> 00:04:37.977
I know this is going to be bad.

00:04:37.977 --> 00:04:41.680 line:0%
♪♪

00:04:41.680 --> 00:04:44.416
Gosh. Ugh!

00:04:44.416 --> 00:04:45.651
Alright, come on, come on.

00:04:45.651 --> 00:04:47.620
Let's make it close.

00:04:47.620 --> 00:04:49.222
Uh! God.

00:04:49.222 --> 00:04:51.757
That was just ugly, ugly!
That was just ugly!

00:04:51.757 --> 00:04:55.628 line:0%
♪♪

00:04:55.628 --> 00:04:59.365 line:0%
-Oh!
-Oh, my God.

00:04:59.365 --> 00:05:02.201
-He's a master. Dude,
he's a ninja. He's a master.

00:05:02.201 --> 00:05:05.938
